Twist TODO List
================

This file contains a list of tasks and features that need to be
implemented or improved in Twist.

High Priority
-------------

  - Review and test the build system on various platforms
  - Add more comprehensive test cases
  - Improve documentation (manual, man pages)

Medium Priority
---------------

  - Implement core functionality (currently a skeleton)
  - Add command-line option parsing library
  - Add internationalization support (gettext)
  - Add logging functionality

Low Priority
------------

  - Add support for additional file formats
  - Add configuration file support
  - Add GUI interface (optional)
  - Add Windows support (via MinGW or Cygwin)

Completed Tasks
--------------

  - Initial project structure following GNU conventions
  - Basic build system setup (autoconf, automake)
  - License and legal files (COPYING, README)
  - Documentation files (AUTHORS, NEWS, ChangeLog, INSTALL)
  - Development guidelines (HACKING)
  - Example source code and test framework

If you would like to contribute to any of these tasks, please contact
the maintainer at <chris@localhost>.
